! Section 9: physical parameters - porous medium                            			

! --------------------------------------------------------------------------			

!   			

'physical parameters - porous medium'                                       			

4                             ;number of property zones      erw_comm: reduced number of layers to 4: top soil - upper layer 1: soil + amendment (116 tn/ha/y), top soil - upper layer 2: soil + amendment (84 tn/ha/y), top soil - lower layer: soil, mineral soil below               						

! --------------------------------		

'number and name of zone'                                                   			

1			

'top soil - upper layer 1'                                                                   			

			

0.547  ;porosity               erw_comm: Based on bulk density used for CDR calculations in Beerling et al. (2024) (dens_b=1.2 kg/L_soil) 

	

'extent of zone'                                                            			

0.0 1.0  0.0 1.0  1.9 2.0			

			

'end of zone'



! --------------------------------		

