'soil hydraulic function parameters'

0.1                            ;S_r  erw_comm: residual saturation

4.0                            ;van genuchten - alpha    erw_comm: set to arbitray values for now. I increased it since the original value made the soil very wet, which is normally not liked by plants (no oxygen)

1.5                            ;van genuchten - n

0.5d0                          ;expn

0.0                            ;air  entry  pressure     erw_comm: set tp 0 for now



'end of zone'



